  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Phua",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Phua.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Laura Phua is an independent Consultant Specialist GP (ABN: 39 675 374 366) (MED0002147725) consulting at the Earlwood centre.",
      "Dr Laura completed a Bachelor of Science degree at UNSW and subsequently completed her medical training at The University of Notre Dame in Sydney. She received postgraduate medical training in various clinical specialties in Bankstown Hospital, Campbelltown Hospital and St. Vincent’s Hospital before entering Family Medicine. She enjoys all aspects of Family Medicine and provides genuine patient-centred care."
    ]
  },
